{#
  Explainer card, md. Same as node--article--card-md without the hide-date test.
  'Explainer' is a translatable interface string: config_translation is not
  enabled, so the content type label can't be translated.

  Explainer styling, 13 September 2026: a green label rather than blue, a rule
  under the date across four fifths of the card, and the question mark above it.
  The date is month and year – an explainer is evergreen, so the day says more
  than it means.

  The question mark is the design's SVG with the export cruft removed – ids,
  data-name attributes and a clip path whose rect was the whole viewBox. It is
  drawn in currentColor, so text-iiedbg-10 colours it; that token is #F9F8F6
  exactly. Not a Noto Serif '?': the theme loads that face at 300, 400, 600 and
  700, so Black would come out as a synthesised bold or a fallback serif.

  Both go in the date block, because card-md opens only the label and date
  blocks. The mark hangs off the top of the date on `bottom-full`, so it always
  clears it, and the wrapper's `mt-20` reserves the 78px it needs, so a long
  title can never reach it. The card is `overflow-hidden`, so the rounded
  corners clip the mark.
#}
{% extends '@iied_tw/node/card/node--card-md.html.twig' %}

  {% block label %}
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 z-10 px-4 pt-2 pb-5 text-stone-900 bg-iiedgreen-500 rounded-tr-xl">
      {{ 'Explainer'|t }}
    </div>
  {% endblock %}

  {% block date %}
    <div class="relative mt-12">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 46.842 73.808" class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 h-[70px] w-auto rotate-10 pointer-events-none text-iiedbg-10">
        <path fill="currentColor" d="M11.519,48.879l.167-11.973a27.508,27.508,0,0,0,9.615-4.2,17.317,17.317,0,0,0,5.233-6.1A27.51,27.51,0,0,0,29,19.036a14.573,14.573,0,0,0-.428-8.026A5.937,5.937,0,0,0,23.8,7.243,5.859,5.859,0,0,0,17.636,9.9q-2.385,3.327-3.561,9.99Q6.914,18.622,3.142,16.161A6.2,6.2,0,0,1,.126,9.422,9.576,9.576,0,0,1,3.545,3.716,16.72,16.72,0,0,1,11.624.373a37.913,37.913,0,0,1,12.9.433A37.207,37.207,0,0,1,37.37,5.331a20.24,20.24,0,0,1,7.739,7.882,15.991,15.991,0,0,1,1.434,10.461q-1.389,7.86-7.056,11.782T22.915,41.864l-3.437,8.421Zm-.473,24.743a10.282,10.282,0,0,1-5.883-2.988q-2.2-2.339-1.342-7.213.879-4.976,3.741-6.367a10.473,10.473,0,0,1,6.542-.743,10.822,10.822,0,0,1,5.843,2.931q2.361,2.316,1.484,7.289-.861,4.876-3.883,6.29a10.611,10.611,0,0,1-6.5.8"/>
      </svg>
      <p class="relative w-4/5 pb-1 border-b text-stone-500 border-iiedgreen-500">{{ node.getCreatedTime|format_date('custom', 'F Y') }}</p>
    </div>
  {% endblock %}
